---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import ServerCard from './ServerCard.astro';
---

<section id="servers" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-8">
  <div data-reveal>
    <SectionHeading num="02." title="自建联机服务器 // DEDICATED SERVER" tag="SERVER" />
  </div>

  <!-- 服务器状态由 scripts/main.ts 从 src/data/server.ts 配置的接口实时拉取 -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:max-w-2xl">
    <ServerCard />
  </div>

  <!-- Notice for Joining Servers -->
  <div
    data-reveal
    class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold text-lg">[!]</span>
      <span class="text-brand-textMuted"
        >目前该部分并不完善，我们还没想到稳定获取服务器状态的方法。</span
      >
    </div>
    <a
      href="#"
      data-alert="占位符：跳转至联机常见问题与模组下载页"
      class="text-white underline hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors shrink-0"
    >
      PLACEHOLDER &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
